---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<main id="main" class="home">
  <section class="wrap hero">
    <div class="hero-top">
      <div class="eyebrow hero-kicker">INDEPENDENT NOTES<br>ON THE DIGITAL WORLD</div>
      <div class="hero-year mono">EST. 2026<br>INDONESIA — ID</div>
    </div>
    <h1>Make room<br><span class="second">for good ideas.</span></h1>
    <div class="hero-bottom">
      <div class="hero-caption">A PERSONAL JOURNAL<br>ABOUT DESIGN, WEB &<br>THINGS WORTH MAKING.</div>
      <p class="intro">Saya menulis tentang <strong>web, desain, teknologi,</strong> dan proses membangun sesuatu yang sederhana namun bermakna. Ini adalah ruang kerja sekaligus catatan terbuka.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap section" id="journal">
    <div class="section-label">
      <div><div class="eyebrow">01 / SELECTED WRITING</div><div class="name">Journal & notes</div></div>
      <div class="desc">Pemikiran, proses, dan catatan yang ingin saya simpan — bukan sekadar mengikuti tren.</div>
      <div class="count mono">{{ collections.posts.length }} ENTRIES</div>
    </div>
    <div class="work-grid">
      {% for post in collections.posts.slice(0, 4) %}
      <article class="work">
        <div class="num index">{{ loop.index }}</div>
        <div>
          <h2><a href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
          <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
          <div class="work-foot">
            <div class="tags">{% for tag in post.data.tags %}{% if tag != "post" %}<span class="tag">{{ tag }}</span>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
            <span class="date">{{ post.date | shortDate }}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="archive-link"><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/journal/' | url }}">VIEW ALL JOURNAL ENTRIES ↗</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap section after-work" id="about">
    <div class="about-layout">
      <div class="about-title"><div class="eyebrow">02 / A LITTLE ABOUT ME</div><div class="about-subtitle">The person behind it.</div></div>
      <p class="about-copy">Saya suka membuat website yang terasa <em>quietly confident</em> — jelas, cepat, dan punya alasan untuk setiap detailnya.</p>
      <div class="about-aside">DESIGN-LED<br>PERFORMANCE-MINDED<br>ALWAYS LEARNING.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="products" id="objects">
      <div class="product-head">
        <div><div class="eyebrow">03 / SMALL DIGITAL GOODS</div><strong>Objects & experiments</strong></div>
        <p>Sesekali saya merilis template dan perangkat kecil yang lahir dari proses kerja sendiri.</p>
        <div class="meta">OCCASIONAL RELEASES ↗</div>
      </div>
      {% for product in site.products %}
      <div class="product-line">
        <div class="kind">{{ product.kind }}</div>
        <div class="product-name"><a href="{{ product.url | url }}">{{ product.name }}</a></div>
        <div class="product-cta">{{ product.status }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap closing">
    <div class="eyebrow">A NOTE BEFORE YOU LEAVE</div>
    <h2>Good things take<br>thought, not noise.</h2>
    <div class="closing-row"><p>Terima kasih sudah mampir. Semoga ada satu ide kecil di sini yang bisa kamu bawa.</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/journal/' | url }}">Explore the journal ↗</a></div>
  </section>
</main>
